00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.990
enable us to do so
much more, and so much

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.800
more efficiently, at work.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.360
And that's something that's
just continually happening.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.360
And at Google, we're
passionate about innovating

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:53.190
in the enterprise
